# The suite hands the cache of the CUDA driver to its tests as lit was given
# it (#223): a suite run with CUDA_CACHE_PATH set had no effect on its
# tests, whose driver cache then stayed in the home directory. The
# temporary files of a test are in a directory that lit makes for the run
# under the TMPDIR that lit was given.
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/environment.py "%suite_cuda_cache_path" "%suite_tmpdir" | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: the cache of the driver is that of the suite
# CHECK-NEXT: temporary files are under the directory of the suite
